WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:03.750
Speaker 1: I am repulsed today.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:10.480
Truly repulsed by having to do this story,
but we are seeing a massive covid resurgence

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:17.820
right now, which is leading to some countries
in stating health passes, new vaccine requirements,

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:22.090
speculative third vaccine doses and much,
much more.

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:27.660
And it's all because we aren't vaccinating
enough people in some parts of the world because

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:32.730
they don't yet have vaccines in the United
States, because we have so many ignorant anti

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:35.050
vaccines here in the United States.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.410
Daily cases are now up.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:37.690
Listen to this.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:40.300
Sixty nine percent.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.410
Sixty nine percent cases up in the United
States.

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:48.100
Globally, cases are now up twenty four percent.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.489
What is happening?

00:00:49.489 --> 00:00:55.040
The Delta variant, combined with not enough
vaccination, the Delta variant is about 60

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:59.480
percent more contagious than the original
variant.

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:02.810
It's spreading, yes, mostly among unvaccinated
people.

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:05.489
That is a testament to the effectiveness of
the vaccines.

00:01:05.489 --> 00:01:10.370
But it's not exclusively among the unvaccinated
because the vaccines aren't 100 percent effective

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:15.090
and the vaccines were not designed specifically
to be tailored to the Delta variant.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:20.010
And right now, as many people in the United
States continue to refuse to get vaccinated,

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:24.760
things are increasingly pointed to a very
ugly fall of twenty, twenty one.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:31.420
I am fully expecting at this point, you know,
three months ago I said in the fall, as we

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:36.660
get into flu season, I would be fine with
saying, hey, we've got to go back to masks

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:39.450
at the grocery store and stuff like that.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:44.509
At this point, I'm fully expecting that masks
are coming back on in the fall in a widespread

00:01:44.509 --> 00:01:47.520
manner unless people really go out and get
vaccinated right now.

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:50.450
Now, as a result, look at what's going on
around the world.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:55.009
Remember, much of the world doesn't yet have
access to vaccines like we have in the US.

00:01:55.009 --> 00:02:00.340
In France, the president, Emmanuel Macron,
is putting in place new health rules, including

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.320
the EU digital covid certificate.

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:05.510
Some people call this the health pass and
it's going to be mandatory.

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:08.840
If you want to go to any cultural venue, if
you want to go to the movies, you will have

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:11.280
to be using the health pass.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:15.830
Starting in August, the health pass will be
mandatory to go to cafes, shops and restaurants,

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.640
as well as trains and planes, among other
places.

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:24.400
France is also going to require health care
workers be vaccinated if they want to continue

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:27.319
working around patients and in health care
settings.

00:02:27.319 --> 00:02:32.870
In Israel, one of the most vaccinated countries
in the world, they are now starting third

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:37.190
doses of the Pfizer vaccine for the most at
risk adults.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.190
Why?

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:39.810
It's relatively speculative.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:46.300
There's the idea that a third dose might provide
more protection, particularly for at risk

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.300
folks.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:50.800
It is not something that the House says is
indicated.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:56.069
The show says, let's keep giving first doses
to completely unvaccinated people.

00:02:56.069 --> 00:03:01.290
But desperation is growing as even Israel
is seeing, OK, it's a very little increase

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:02.420
in cases.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:05.730
Israel is so highly vaccinated that it's not
a big increase.

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:10.670
But there are more breakthrough cases happening
in Israel as well as Delta variant cases among

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:12.850
people who have not been vaccinated.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:19.599
Tennessee has now fired its top vaccine official
because covid-19 is showing signs of massive

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:21.460
spread in Tennessee.

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:25.650
California cases are now up one hundred and
eighty one percent compared to the previous

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:26.650
week.

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:28.159
So is there any good news?

00:03:28.159 --> 00:03:34.080
The good news continues to be we have a tool
that works really well against the Delta variant

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.670
if we all use it.

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:42.230
And when a vaccinated person does get infected,
they are overwhelmingly, completely asymptomatic.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:48.680
Most Breakthru vaccinated infections are asymptomatic,
not all, and there are vaccinated people who

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:49.680
have died.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:56.170
I understand that now in the US, officials
are saying almost all recent hospitalizations

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.159
and deaths are unvaccinated people.

00:03:58.159 --> 00:04:00.849
And that's true, but not all.

00:04:00.849 --> 00:04:02.400
And this is a community effort.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.319
This is a joint effort here.

00:04:04.319 --> 00:04:09.170
There are countries that, as they get access
to the vaccine, are already seeing way more

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:12.250
interest in getting it than we've seen in
the United States.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.860
Look at Canada, for example.

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:18.599
Canada got significant vaccine access much
later than the United States, and yet they're

00:04:18.599 --> 00:04:22.659
quickly catching up to the US in terms of
per capita second doses.

00:04:22.659 --> 00:04:26.409
So we need to deal with anti vaccines somehow.

00:04:26.409 --> 00:04:29.749
And there are real concerns about what things
look like in the fall.

00:04:29.749 --> 00:04:32.289
If we don't do that, just look at the numbers.

00:04:32.289 --> 00:04:33.289
These are not vague.

00:04:33.289 --> 00:04:34.740
You know, it's so easy to hear these headlines.

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:36.419
Oh, it's more contagious.

00:04:36.419 --> 00:04:41.949
Oh, some people don't want to get and have
some total disconnect from the fact that this

00:04:41.949 --> 00:04:46.660
means people develop symptoms that get so
bad that they go to the hospital and some

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:48.020
