00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:52.110
And it can mostly be avoided just by going
and getting vaccinated.

00:04:52.110 --> 00:05:00.629
So the fall I understand that this is becoming
overwhelmingly a pandemic of the unvaccinated,

00:05:00.629 --> 00:05:02.619
